      "review_description": "Pinnacle Solar installed a 10kW system at our home in October 2024, and the entire experience was exceptional from start to finish.The sales and quoting process was smooth and transparent — no pressure, just honest advice and detailed explanations that helped us choose the best system for our needs. Sargon and his team was punctual, polite, and very tidy. They worked efficiently and showed great respect for our property, leaving everything clean and in perfect order.Customer service was truly a standout. The team was extremely knowledgeable and approachable, guiding us through the post-installation process, including organising the grid connection and showing us how to monitor the system. It’s rare to come across such a seamless and professional service these days.Highly recommend Pinnacle Solar for anyone looking for a stress-free, quality solar installation.",
